n on Saturday and scheduling the 6-hour commissioning during a different window. Ravi, is that feasible, or does the retrofit need to be done as a single continuous 8-hour sequence? Before I finalize my decision, I need those two answers: Monique on Press 2 flexibility, and Ravi on whether the retrofit can be staged. I also want commitments from each of you: Ravi, attach your bench-test note to the work order today. Gareth, enter your arc-flash review into the safety permit system today. Sofia, link the revised control plan to the work order today. Let's get those done regardless of the final retrofit decision."
